00:21:27.020 --> 00:21:28.760
So now it is beach day.
他显然把凉鞋度假村礼品店里能买的东西全买了。

382
00:21:28.980 --> 00:21:33.800
And at 2 minutes, 28 seconds, you get a fantastic look at Michael's outfit.
他穿了件T恤。

383
00:21:34.000 --> 00:21:38.620
He clearly bought everything he could at Sandals in the gift shop.
戴了顶帽子。

384
00:21:38.940 --> 00:21:40.020
He's got a t-shirt.
他还戴了一条项链，可能是那儿买的，那种小贝壳项链。

385
00:21:40.140 --> 00:21:40.780
He's got a hat.
他真是准备充分。

386
00:21:40.980 --> 00:21:44.600
He has a necklace that he probably bought there, a little puka shell necklace.
他还告诉大家出发前最好先去上个厕所。

