00:21:46.320 --> 00:21:51.040
And he tells everyone they better go potty before they leave.
你知道，他就是那样。

389
00:21:51.040 --> 00:21:53.300
I'm just like, Michael's so ready to be a dad.
真是难为他了。

390
00:21:53.300 --> 00:21:55.440
You know, he just is.
你可以看到每个人都穿着休闲装。

391
00:21:55.660 --> 00:21:56.320
Bless his heart.
我真的很喜欢。

392
00:21:56.720 --> 00:21:59.780
And you get to see everybody in casual attire.
嗯，我注意到我们的服装有个特点。

