00:22:26.640 --> 00:22:30.380
There was this crazy freak March heat wave.
三月份竟然出现了这种疯狂的异常热浪。

404
00:22:30.560 --> 00:22:32.200
It was 98 degrees.
气温高达98华氏度。

405
00:22:32.380 --> 00:22:36.420
I wrote in my journal that it was 98 degrees our first day.
我在日记里写道，我们第一天的气温是98华氏度。

406
00:22:37.100 --> 00:22:37.480
Yeah.
没错。

407
00:22:37.860 --> 00:22:42.360
But then when the sun went down, it was freezing cold.
但太阳一落山，就冷得要命。

408
00:22:42.540 --> 00:22:42.660
Yeah.
是啊。

409
00:22:42.780 --> 00:22:43.820
We're in this valley.
我们身处山谷之中。

410
00:22:43.820 --> 00:22:47.180
So it was like these really huge swings of temperature.
所以温差非常大。

411
00:22:47.920 --> 00:22:48.400
Yeah.
没错。

412
00:22:48.600 --> 00:22:54.920
So wardrobe tried to give us layers to help take us between these two extreme temperatures.
所以服装组试图给我们提供叠穿的衣服，以应对这两种极端气温。

413
00:22:54.920 --> 00:22:59.000
And I noticed when I was looking at everyone's beach attire.
当我观察大家的沙滩装束时，我注意到了这一点。

414
00:22:59.820 --> 00:23:00.680
Their layers.
他们的叠穿搭配。

415
00:23:01.040 --> 00:23:02.260
Well, you know what I noticed?
你知道我注意到了什么吗？

416
00:23:02.480 --> 00:23:04.360
This is really, really fun to me.
我觉得这真的非常非常有意思。

417
00:23:04.880 --> 00:23:07.440
Toby and Angela almost have on the same outfit.
托比和安吉拉穿的几乎是一模一样的衣服。

418
00:23:08.180 --> 00:23:08.600
What?
什么？

419
00:23:08.780 --> 00:23:10.080
I did not notice that.
我没注意到。

420
00:23:10.080 --> 00:23:12.320
They're both wearing these beige tops.
他们都穿着米色的上衣。

421
00:23:12.480 --> 00:23:17.460
They have huge beige floppy hats and like sort of like just like pants on.
他们戴着巨大的米色软檐帽，还穿着那种裤子。

422
00:23:17.640 --> 00:23:20.200
But like and they're also both obsessed with sunscreen.
而且他们俩都对防晒霜非常执着。

423
00:23:20.440 --> 00:23:21.180
Both of them.
他们俩都是。

424
00:23:22.000 --> 00:23:27.260
Well, I noticed that both Andy and Stanley are wearing a red polo shirt.
嗯，我注意到安迪和斯坦利都穿着红色的Polo衫。

425
00:23:27.520 --> 00:23:29.000
Oh, yeah.
噢，确实。

426
00:23:29.220 --> 00:23:30.220
I did not catch that.
我没发现这一点。

427
00:23:30.380 --> 00:23:32.120
But guess what I did catch?
但你猜我发现了什么？

428
00:23:32.220 --> 00:23:34.920
And I know it's your favorite moment of the day.
我知道这是你一天中最喜欢的时刻。

429
00:23:35.620 --> 00:23:37.680
Is it a new plant at reception?
是前台换了新植物吗？

430
00:23:37.680 --> 00:23:39.360
Because we need a sting for this.
因为我们需要为此配个音效。

431
00:23:39.680 --> 00:23:41.260
New plant alert.
新植物警报。

432
00:23:41.680 --> 00:23:43.520
Three minutes, 32 seconds.
三分32秒。

433
